WEBVTT

00:07.862 --> 00:09.172
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.206 --> 00:10.862
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.896 --> 00:12.344
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.379 --> 00:14.482
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.517 --> 00:17.344
- ♪ Ohh...
- ♪ 哦...

00:17.379 --> 00:19.448
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.482 --> 00:21.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.482 --> 00:23.344
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.379 --> 00:25.206
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.241 --> 00:27.482
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.517 --> 00:29.344
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.379 --> 00:31.413
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.448 --> 00:33.448
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.482 --> 00:35.310
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.344 --> 00:37.620
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.655 --> 00:39.551
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.586 --> 00:40.896
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.931 --> 00:42.758
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.793 --> 00:45.482
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.517 --> 00:47.793
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:47.827 --> 00:49.413
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.551 --> 00:54.517
[folksy music]
[民谣音乐]

00:54.551 --> 01:01.655
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:04.448 --> 01:05.655
- Laser wrench.
- 激光扳手。

01:05.689 --> 01:06.655
- Mm-hmm.
- 嗯嗯。

01:06.689 --> 01:07.862
- Nope.
- 没有。

01:07.896 --> 01:09.034
- Ah.
- Uh-uh.
- 啊。
- 呃呃。

01:09.068 --> 01:11.241
- Mm?
- Not even close.
- 毫米？
- 甚至还没有接近。

01:11.275 --> 01:13.793
- [laughs]
- No. No. No.
- [笑]
- 不，不，不。

01:13.827 --> 01:14.896
- Ohh!
[honking]
- 哦！
[鸣喇叭]

01:14.931 --> 01:17.310
- Ugh, fine! It'll do.
- 呃，好吧！就可以了

01:17.344 --> 01:18.655
Hm?
嗯？

01:19.413 --> 01:20.689
[doorbell chimes]
[门铃响]

01:20.724 --> 01:22.724
- I'll get it!
- 我会得到它！

01:23.586 --> 01:26.482
- Surprise!
- 惊喜！

01:26.517 --> 01:28.034
[children giggling]
[孩子们咯咯笑]

01:28.068 --> 01:29.896
Hi-ya, sis!
嗨，姐姐！

01:29.931 --> 01:31.379
- Howdy!
- Auntie!
- 你好！
- 阿姨！

01:31.413 --> 01:32.448
- Sandy!
- 桑迪！

01:32.482 --> 01:35.896
' Oh, I didn't expect
y'all till tomorrow.
’哦，我没想到
你们都到明天吧。

01:35.931 --> 01:38.241
- I know how much you love
your nieces,
- 我知道你有多爱
你的侄女们，

01:38.275 --> 01:40.275
y'know, so I brought 'em
a day early.
你知道，所以我把它们带来了
早一天。

01:40.310 --> 01:42.758
- SpongeBob, this here's
my sister Rosy
- 海绵宝宝，这是
我的妹妹罗西

01:42.793 --> 01:44.137
and my three nieces.
和我的三个侄女。

01:44.172 --> 01:47.068
This'n here's Macadamia.
- How do?
这就是澳洲坚果。
- 怎么办？

01:47.103 --> 01:49.241
- Hazelnut.
- How do?
- 榛子。
- 怎么办？

01:49.275 --> 01:50.724
- And little Pistachio.
- 还有小开心果。

01:50.758 --> 01:53.034
- How d--[belches]
- 怎么了--[打嗝]

01:53.068 --> 01:54.172
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

01:54.206 --> 01:56.034
- Girls, this is my friend
SpongeBob!
- 女孩们，这是我的朋友
海绵宝宝！

01:56.068 --> 01:59.275
- Aww, what sweet little
angels!
- 哇哦，多么可爱的小东西啊
天使！

01:59.310 --> 02:00.965
- [laughs nervously]
Yeah, angels.
- [紧张地笑]
是的，天使。

02:01.000 --> 02:03.517
Okay, well I gotta skedaddle.
好吧，我得溜了。

02:05.310 --> 02:07.206
Freedom!
自由！

02:07.862 --> 02:09.827
- Doggone it.
They're too early!
- 完蛋了。
他们来得太早了！

02:09.862 --> 02:12.068
I'm not finished
with their present!
我还没说完
带着他们的礼物！

02:12.103 --> 02:13.689
- Don't worry your pretty
little head, little lady.
- 别担心你的漂亮
小头，小女人。

02:13.724 --> 02:16.034
I'll watch the
gals until you're done!
我会看
姑娘们，直到你完成为止！

02:16.068 --> 02:18.034
- Thanks, SpongeBob,
but there's something
- 谢谢，海绵宝宝，
但有件事

02:18.068 --> 02:19.655
I gotta tell you
about babysitting my--
我得告诉你
关于照顾我的——

02:19.689 --> 02:22.344
- [chuckles] Yeah, I think I
know a little something
- [笑] 是的，我想我
知道一点东西

02:22.379 --> 02:25.137
about babysitting, Sandy.
关于保姆，桑迪。

02:25.965 --> 02:27.551
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

02:29.551 --> 02:30.896
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

02:30.931 --> 02:31.965
'Scuse me.
对不起。

02:32.000 --> 02:34.344
- Y'all mind your
Uncle SpongeBob now.
- 你们介意你的
现在是海绵宝宝叔叔了

02:37.586 --> 02:39.275
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:39.896 --> 02:41.965
Story time!
故事时间！

02:42.000 --> 02:43.448
[inhales, blows]
[吸气，吹气]

02:43.482 --> 02:45.896
Goldyfish and the Three
Sea Bears.
金鱼和三人组
海熊。

02:45.931 --> 02:48.896
Chapter one,
breaking and entering.
第一章，
破门而入。

02:48.931 --> 02:49.965
- Don't waste your breath...
- 别浪费口气了...

02:50.000 --> 02:51.310
- And don't make a hassle...
- 别惹麻烦...

02:51.344 --> 02:53.000
- Some kids like to read...
- 有些孩子喜欢读书...

02:53.034 --> 02:55.413
[together]
But we'd rather wrassle!
[一起]
但我们宁愿吵架！

02:57.689 --> 03:01.620
- Now you girls go easy on
me, okay? [giggles]
- 现在你们女孩们放轻松点
我，好吗？ [咯咯笑]

03:01.655 --> 03:03.310
- One!
- [yelps]
- 一！
- [尖叫声]

03:04.103 --> 03:05.482
[groans]
[呻吟]

03:05.517 --> 03:07.620
- Two!
- 二！

03:13.758 --> 03:16.551
- [straining]
- [紧张]

03:18.103 --> 03:19.931
[chuckles] Ow!
[笑] 噢！

03:21.793 --> 03:23.241
- Ugh.
- 呃。

03:23.275 --> 03:25.172
Why don't ya show the girls
around town?
为什么不让女孩们看看
城镇周围？

03:25.206 --> 03:27.586
- Great idea!
- 好主意！

03:29.793 --> 03:33.344
I'll take them to the funnest
place in all of Bikini Bottom!
我会带他们去最好玩的地方
放置在所有比基尼底部！

03:36.275 --> 03:38.655
The Krusty Krab!
蟹堡王！

03:40.793 --> 03:43.275
Mr. Krabs, these are Sandy's
little nieces.
蟹老板，这些是桑迪的
小侄女们。

03:43.310 --> 03:45.517
- Oh, nieces eh?
- 哦，侄女们是吧？

03:45.551 --> 03:48.689
And what brings such cute
little customers
是什么带来如此可爱
小顾客

03:48.724 --> 03:49.586
to Bikini Bottom?
到比基尼底部？

03:49.620 --> 03:52.068
- We're visiting
Auntie Sandy...
- 我们正在拜访
桑迪阿姨...

03:52.103 --> 03:53.827
- And we want to sling hash...
- 我们想要吊起哈希......

03:53.862 --> 03:55.448
- A chophouse like this
must be...
- 像这样的小餐馆
一定是……

03:55.482 --> 03:57.517
[together]
Loaded with cash!
[一起]
满载现金！

03:57.551 --> 04:00.379
- Aww! Go on!
- 哇！继续！

04:01.103 --> 04:03.931
No, really. Go on.
不，真的。继续。

04:13.551 --> 04:17.586
- This is my coworker-slash-
best buddy Squidward.
-这是我的同事-斜线-
最好的朋友章鱼哥。

04:17.620 --> 04:19.896
- Ugh. Children.
- 呃。孩子们。

04:19.931 --> 04:21.896
- Ugh. Grownups.
- 呃。大人。

04:21.931 --> 04:23.931
- This feller ain't happy.
- 这家伙不高兴。

04:23.965 --> 04:25.275
- Just look at his face.
- 看看他的脸就知道了。

04:25.310 --> 04:28.586
[together] We're gonna be sick,
all over the place!
[一起]我们会生病，
到处都是！

04:28.620 --> 04:30.241
- [moans]
- [呻吟]

04:31.000 --> 04:32.275
- [muttering]
- [嘀咕]

04:32.310 --> 04:35.724
Here you go!
Three Dolly Patties.
干得好！
三个多莉肉饼。

04:35.758 --> 04:37.724
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

04:40.172 --> 04:41.896
- [imitates Krabs]
- [模仿螃蟹]

04:41.931 --> 04:44.241
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

04:45.068 --> 04:46.551
- Can you stop playing dress-up
- 你能别再玩换装游戏了吗

04:46.586 --> 04:48.827
long enough to make some
Krabby Patties?
足够长的时间做一些
蟹肉饼？

04:48.862 --> 04:50.689
[blubbering]
[哭泣]

04:50.724 --> 04:53.758
- Huh! Guess that's me
all over. [laughs]
- 哈！猜猜那是我
一切都结束了。 [笑]

04:53.793 --> 04:56.172
- [chortles]
- [咯咯笑]

04:56.206 --> 04:58.655
You two look ridiculerous!
你们两个看起来很可笑！

04:58.689 --> 05:01.137
- [yipping]
- [嘶叫]

05:01.413 --> 05:04.310
- Ha! You're your own
worst enemy.
- 哈！你是你自己的
最坏的敌人。

05:04.344 --> 05:06.206
- SpongeBob, from now on
——海绵宝宝，从现在开始

05:06.241 --> 05:08.620
babysit off Krusty Krab
Property!
蟹堡礁附近的保姆
财产！

05:08.655 --> 05:12.724
And Mr. Squidward, dress like
SpongeBob on yer own time.
还有章鱼哥先生，穿得像
海绵宝宝在你自己的时间。

05:13.241 --> 05:14.965
- That place really stunk.
- 那个地方真的很臭。

05:15.000 --> 05:16.448
- It was lamer than lame.
- 简直比蹩脚还要蹩脚。

05:16.482 --> 05:18.137
- Take us somewhere fun.
- 带我们去好玩的地方。

05:18.172 --> 05:20.896
[together]
Or taste Texas pain!
[一起]
或者尝尝德克萨斯州的痛苦！

05:20.931 --> 05:23.310
- Aww, what cute little
knuckles you have.
- 哇哦，多么可爱的小东西啊
你有指关节。

05:23.344 --> 05:25.000
Hmm, hmm...
嗯嗯……

05:25.034 --> 05:26.896
ooh, I've got just the spot.
哦，我刚好有位置。

05:28.344 --> 05:31.862
[funky music]
[时髦音乐]

05:31.896 --> 05:33.344
[inhales] Ahhh,
[吸气] 啊哈，

05:33.379 --> 05:36.551
smell that fresh seawater.
闻到新鲜的海水的味道。

05:37.482 --> 05:39.965
Oh, heh-hey, right. Sorry.
哦，嘿嘿，对了。对不起。

05:40.000 --> 05:41.137
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:41.172 --> 05:42.793
[all yelp]
[大家尖叫]

05:42.827 --> 05:44.724
[contented sighs]
[满足的叹息]

05:44.758 --> 05:47.344
- [yawns] See, Sandy,
nothing to worry about.
- [哈欠]看，桑迪，
没什么好担心的。

05:47.379 --> 05:50.103
Baby-sitting is eaaaaasy.
保姆是 eaaaaasy。

05:50.137 --> 05:52.344
[snoring]
[打鼾]

05:53.896 --> 05:55.896
- Hey, Uncle SpongeBob!
- 嘿，海绵宝宝叔叔！

05:55.931 --> 05:56.896
- Huh?
- 啊？

05:56.931 --> 05:58.758
- Open your eyes!
- 睁开你的眼睛！

05:59.931 --> 06:01.689
- You're just gonna love...
- 你只会爱...

06:01.724 --> 06:02.551
- Hm?
- 嗯？

06:02.586 --> 06:04.931
all: Our sandy surprise!
所有人：我们的沙滩惊喜！

06:04.965 --> 06:06.241
- It's our gift to you!
- 这是我们送给你的礼物！

06:06.275 --> 06:08.206
- Well, isn't that sweet!
- 嗯，是不是很甜蜜！

06:08.241 --> 06:09.724
- And it won't wash away...
- 而且它不会被冲走...

06:09.758 --> 06:12.034
- 'Cause it's made of concrete!
- 因为它是混凝土制成的！

06:12.068 --> 06:13.862
- Concrete, wha--?
- 具体的，什么--？

06:13.896 --> 06:17.344
Good structural integrity,
girls, but a little tight!
良好的结构完整性，
女孩子，不过有点紧！

06:17.379 --> 06:20.310
- So sorry, Uncle.
- We made it too small...
- 很抱歉，叔叔。
- 我们把它弄得太小了...

06:20.344 --> 06:22.206
- But we'll get you out...
- 但我们会把你救出来...

06:22.241 --> 06:24.827
both: With this wrecking ball!
两人：用这个破坏球！

06:25.379 --> 06:26.310
- Wrecking what?
- 破坏什么？

06:26.344 --> 06:29.034
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:33.827 --> 06:34.931
- [squawks]
- [嘎嘎声]

06:35.965 --> 06:38.034
- [straining]
- [紧张]

06:38.068 --> 06:41.724
Let's all go to my house
and take a little break.
我们都去我家吧
休息一下。

06:41.758 --> 06:43.034
[moaning]
[呻吟]

06:48.379 --> 06:50.689
[girls humming]
[女孩们哼唱]

06:53.034 --> 06:54.068
Here we are, girls.
我们在这里，女孩们。

06:54.103 --> 06:56.689
Pineapple, sweet pine--whoa!
菠萝，甜松——哇！

06:56.724 --> 07:01.758
- I've been waiting all day
to watch your TV!
-我已经等了一整天了
看你的电视！

07:02.482 --> 07:05.068
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

07:05.103 --> 07:07.310
- Patrick, you could have
watched it while I was out.
- 帕特里克，你可以
我出去的时候看了它。

07:07.344 --> 07:10.000
- I forgot how to make it work!
- 我忘记了如何让它发挥作用！

07:10.034 --> 07:11.172
Show me!
给我看看！

07:11.206 --> 07:13.103
Show me funny!
给我看看有趣的！

07:13.137 --> 07:15.000
I wanna see stories!
我想看故事！

07:15.034 --> 07:17.275
Go, go! [sobbing]
走吧，走吧！ [抽泣]

07:17.310 --> 07:18.551
Please!
请！

07:18.586 --> 07:20.655
- Boop. There you go.
- 噗。就这样吧。

07:23.310 --> 07:26.793
- I don't know how you remember
all this technical stuff.
- 我不知道你是怎么记得的
所有这些技术性的东西。

07:26.827 --> 07:30.000
- Yeah. Patrick,
meet Sandy's nieces.
- 是的。帕特里克，
认识桑迪的侄女们。

07:30.034 --> 07:31.965
- Good to meet ya!
- 很高兴认识你！

07:32.517 --> 07:35.068
- Hey kids,
know what time it is?
- 嘿孩子们，
知道现在几点了吗？

07:35.103 --> 07:37.310
It's nutcrackin' time!
现在是胡桃夹时间！

07:37.344 --> 07:39.517
- [giggling]
I love this episode!
- [咯咯笑]
我喜欢这一集！

07:39.551 --> 07:41.620
- Well, well,
what do you know?!
- 好吧，好吧，
你知道什么？！

07:41.655 --> 07:44.793
[together] Patrick is watching
our favorite show!
[一起] 帕特里克正在观看
我们最喜欢的节目！

07:46.379 --> 07:48.931
- Ah, finally, I can relax.
- 啊，终于可以放松了。

07:48.965 --> 07:50.793
With work!
与工作！

07:50.827 --> 07:52.862
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

07:58.310 --> 08:00.172
[slurping]
[发出声音]

08:06.034 --> 08:07.862
- [straining]
- [紧张]

08:10.034 --> 08:11.655
Hmph!
哼！

08:17.241 --> 08:18.827
Ah, that's better.
啊，这样好多了。

08:18.862 --> 08:21.034
[girls growling]
[女孩们咆哮]

08:21.068 --> 08:22.931
Aww!
哇！

08:24.137 --> 08:26.379
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

08:26.413 --> 08:28.655
[girls giggling]
[女孩们咯咯地笑]

08:34.379 --> 08:36.103
[growling]
[咆哮]

08:36.137 --> 08:37.931
[girls yelp]
[女孩们尖叫]

08:37.965 --> 08:40.000
[chortling]
[咯咯笑]

08:40.758 --> 08:42.758
- Let's launch this goof...
- 让我们启动这个傻瓜......

08:42.793 --> 08:44.724
[together] Right to the roof!
[合] 到屋顶了！

08:46.103 --> 08:48.310
[chuckles] Lift-off!
[笑]起飞！

08:48.344 --> 08:49.551
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

08:49.586 --> 08:51.586
[all giggling]
[大家咯咯地笑]

08:51.620 --> 08:53.965
Whoo! Whoo-hoo!
呼！呼呼！

08:54.000 --> 08:56.206
- Who wants brownies?
- 谁想要布朗尼蛋糕？

08:57.724 --> 09:00.241
Heh. I'll go make
another batch.
呵呵。我去制作
另一批。

09:00.275 --> 09:02.034
[all giggling]
[大家咯咯地笑]

09:02.068 --> 09:04.172
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

09:04.206 --> 09:06.758
- Let's send this nit-wit--
- On his way!
- 让我们发送这个傻瓜 -
- 在路上！

09:06.793 --> 09:09.827
- Before he ruins our whole
dern day!
- 在他毁掉我们之前
今天！

09:09.862 --> 09:10.620
- Yeah!
- 是的！

09:10.655 --> 09:12.896
[laughing evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

09:15.827 --> 09:18.931
- All aboard for Glove World!
- 全体一起前往手套世界！

09:18.965 --> 09:20.862
- Huh-huh-ha!
- 哈哈哈！

09:23.103 --> 09:25.172
- Save me a brownie!
- 给我一个布朗尼！

09:25.206 --> 09:26.482
- He'll be away...
- 他会离开...

09:26.517 --> 09:28.793
all: The whole dern day!
全体：一整天！

09:28.827 --> 09:32.068
[door opens]
- Hi! I brought some friends.
[门打开]
- 嗨！我带了一些朋友来。

09:36.724 --> 09:40.103
- Ooh! I'll have to make more
brownies!
- 哦！我得赚更多
布朗尼蛋糕！

09:40.137 --> 09:44.068
- All y'all shoo,
you're blocking our view!
- 你们都快点，
你挡住了我们的视线！

09:44.103 --> 09:45.448
- Excuse us.
- Sorry.
- 对不起。
- 对不起。

09:45.482 --> 09:46.551
- Sorry, ma'am.
- 对不起，女士。

09:46.586 --> 09:48.137
- We're taking that seat--
- 我们坐那个座位--

09:48.172 --> 09:49.344
- Right where you sit!
- 就在你坐的地方！

09:49.379 --> 09:51.206
- What you gonna do?
- 你要做什么？

09:51.241 --> 09:53.310
all: Let's wrassle for it!
全体：我们一起奋斗吧！

09:55.448 --> 09:57.965
- Ready, set...
- 准备好，开始……

09:58.000 --> 09:58.965
wrassle!
扭打！

09:59.000 --> 10:00.172
[bell dings]
[铃声]

10:01.034 --> 10:02.655
[all straining]
[一切都紧张]

10:02.689 --> 10:05.862
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

10:05.896 --> 10:09.448
♪
♪
♪
♪

10:09.482 --> 10:11.482
- Ooh, brownie!
- 哦，布朗尼！

10:11.517 --> 10:12.517
[together] Huh?
[合]啊？

10:12.551 --> 10:14.758
- You saved me one! Thanks!
- 你救了我一个！谢谢！

10:15.965 --> 10:18.862
Guess I get the TV.
[chuckles]
我猜我得到了电视。
[笑声]

10:19.517 --> 10:21.241
- That guy's mean!
- 那家伙太卑鄙了！

10:21.275 --> 10:23.137
- Where's our auntie?!
- 我们的阿姨在哪里？

10:23.172 --> 10:24.689
- We gon' leave!
- 我们要走了！

10:24.724 --> 10:28.068
all: We want Sandy!
所有人：我们想要桑迪！

10:28.103 --> 10:30.689
[crying]
[哭泣]

10:31.586 --> 10:35.275
- Oh Auntie Sandy,
what a terrible place!
-哦桑迪阿姨，
多么可怕的地方啊！

10:35.310 --> 10:37.413
- Everyone was so mean!
- 每个人都太卑鄙了！

10:37.448 --> 10:39.275
- Right to our face!
- 就在我们面前！

10:39.310 --> 10:41.517
- Aw, don't fret,
little ladies.
- 噢，别担心，
小女士们。

10:41.551 --> 10:44.896
I made a present just for
you, you, and you.
我做了一份礼物只是为了
你，你，还有你。

10:48.413 --> 10:50.310
- From a rattlesnake's tail...
- 来自响尾蛇的尾巴......

10:50.344 --> 10:52.137
- To an armadillo's chest...
- 到犰狳的胸口...

10:52.172 --> 10:53.586
- Our Auntie Sandy...
- 我们的桑迪阿姨...

10:53.620 --> 10:56.103
[together]
Is the gol'durn best!
[一起]
是goldurn最好的！

10:56.137 --> 10:58.137
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

11:00.827 --> 11:02.896
- Oh, sorry, Sandy.
- 哦，对不起，桑迪。

11:02.931 --> 11:08.413
I guess I'm just not a very
good babysitter.
我想我只是不是一个很
好保姆。

11:08.448 --> 11:11.965
- I tried to tell ya the first
rule of babysitting my nieces.
- 我试着先告诉你
照顾我侄女的规则。

11:12.000 --> 11:14.931
- What's that?
- Don't babysit my nieces!
- 那是什么？
- 别照顾我的侄女！

11:16.655 --> 11:18.379
[together] Bye, Auntie Sandy!
[合]再见，桑迪阿姨！

11:18.413 --> 11:20.310
Bye, Uncle SpongeBob!
再见，海绵宝宝叔叔！

11:22.172 --> 11:25.344
- Bye, bye! Have a nice trip
back to Texas!
- 再见，再见！祝你旅途愉快
回到德克萨斯州！

11:25.379 --> 11:28.068
Bless their evil little hearts.
祝福他们邪恶的小心。

11:28.103 --> 11:31.103
[folksy music]
[民谣音乐]

11:32.103 --> 11:33.655
- Ahhh.
- 啊哈。

11:34.896 --> 11:36.034
[gasps]
[喘气]

11:36.068 --> 11:37.206
Oh, no.
哦，不。

11:37.241 --> 11:38.620
[grunts]
[咕哝]

11:38.655 --> 11:41.034
[together]
Hi, Maw! Did ya miss us?
[一起]
嗨，妈！你想念我们吗？

11:41.068 --> 11:42.448
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

- [叹气]